00:09:41.814 --> 00:09:42.815
and here

00:09:42.815 --> 00:09:44.317
where the international community

00:09:44.317 --> 00:09:46.319
should help us not only to,

00:09:46.319 --> 00:09:48.421
you know, to examine the aftermath,

00:09:48.421 --> 00:09:50.690
but also to bring to justice

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:52.291
those people.

00:09:52.291 --> 00:09:53.626
And this leadership

00:09:53.626 --> 00:09:54.794
was responsible

00:09:54.794 --> 00:09:55.761
to make of this

00:09:55.761 --> 00:09:57.330
terrible ecocide

00:09:57.330 --> 00:09:59.565
in the 21st century Yugoslavia.

00:09:59.599 --> 00:10:00.700
Thank you very much.

